{"seq":1,"slug":"conveyor-topology-accumulation-flow","title":"输送线拓扑、积放与流量控制（ZPA）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/warehouse-control-system-sortation-automation-asrs/conveyor-sortation-routing/conveyor-topology-accumulation-flow","wordCount":2949,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"输送线拓扑-积放与流量控制-zpa\">输送线拓扑、积放与流量控制（ZPA）</h1><p>输送线不是一条&quot;会动的带子&quot;，而是一张由<strong>区段（zone）</strong>、<strong>汇流点（merge）</strong>、<strong>分流点（divert）<strong>和</strong>缓存段</strong>构成的拓扑图，由 WCS 在此图上做离散事件调度。工程师真正要回答的问题只有三个：包裹在哪个区段、下一步允许不允许它走、以及当它受阻时应该停在哪。ZPA（Zero-Pressure Accumulation，零压力积放）就是回答第三个问题的工程答案——它让任意一段输送线上的单件货在受阻时<strong>不停在下一件货的正后方</strong>，而是保持一个物理间隙，从而避免挤压、堆叠与由此产生的卡件和货损。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>理解输送线拓扑，先分清三类节点。**运输段（transport）**是纯移动，不缓存；**积放段（accumulation）**允许单件货在不为零的速度下&quot;等待&quot;，是流量的缓冲池；**决策点（decision point）**包括合流、分流、扫描与称重，是拓扑中唯一会改变路由的节点。MHI（美国物料搬运工业协会）的物料搬运基础资料把输送线操作归纳为 transport、accumulation、sorting 三类 [来源：Wikipedia, Conveyor system — Accumulation, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Conveyor_system]，这与上述划分完全一致。\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Conveyor_system]，这与上述划分完全一致。</a></p>\n<p>积放技术本身经历过三代。**接触积放（contact accumulation）**让包裹首尾相接，靠机械离合器或低摩擦辊子把驱动力传下去，优点是密度最高，缺点是压力会累积到队列前段；**零压力积放（ZPA）**要求队列中每件货之间保留一个&quot;把手宽度&quot;的间隙；<strong>动态积放（dynamic accumulation）<strong>则在运行中维持更小的间隙，只在末端制动，兼顾密度与保护。ZPA 的实现基础是</strong>电动滚筒（MDR，Motorized Drive Roller）</strong>：BLDC 电机内嵌在滚筒管体内，一根驱动滚筒带动少数几根从动滚筒，构成一个&quot;可独立控制的输送区段 [来源：Wikipedia, Roller conveyor — Motorized Drive Roller, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Roller_conveyor]&quot;。一个标准\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Roller_conveyor]&quot;。一个标准</a> MDR 区段的承载能力约为 <strong>35 kg（75 lb）</strong>，这个数字直接决定单区段能放几件货、能否整段制动 [来源：Wikipedia, Conveyor system，同上]。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[投放/induct] --&gt; B[扫描称重&lt;br/&gt;decision point]&#10;    B --&gt; C[运输段&lt;br/&gt;transport]&#10;    C --&gt; D{汇流点&lt;br/&gt;merge}&#10;    E[支线投入] --&gt; D&#10;    D --&gt; F[积放段 ZPA&lt;br/&gt;zone 1..n]&#10;    F --&gt; G[分流点&lt;br/&gt;divert to chute]&#10;    F --&gt; H[继续主线]&#10;    G --&gt; I[格口/打包]\">graph TD\n    A[投放/induct] --&gt; B[扫描称重&lt;br/&gt;decision point]\n    B --&gt; C[运输段&lt;br/&gt;transport]\n    C --&gt; D{汇流点&lt;br/&gt;merge}\n    E[支线投入] --&gt; D\n    D --&gt; F[积放段 ZPA&lt;br/&gt;zone 1..n]\n    F --&gt; G[分流点&lt;br/&gt;divert to chute]\n    F --&gt; H[继续主线]\n    G --&gt; I[格口/打包]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>节点类型</th>\n<th>是否缓存</th>\n<th>控制目标</th>\n<th>典型失效模式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>运输段 transport</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>恒定线速、最小间距</td>\n<td>卡件、跑偏</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>积放段 ZPA</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>保持单件间隙、末端制动</td>\n<td>区段误判、幽灵包裹</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>汇流点 merge</td>\n<td>否（瞬态）</td>\n<td>仲裁优先权、防碰撞</td>\n<td>两线同时放行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分流点 divert</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>目标格口路由正确</td>\n<td>错分、抛件</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"输送线拓扑建模-区段-汇流与分流\">输送线拓扑建模：区段、汇流与分流</h2><p>拓扑建模的最小单元是<strong>区段</strong>，而不是电机。一个区段由一段可独立驱动/制动的滚筒组加上一组检测元件（通常是光电传感器或漫反射开关）定义。WCS 内部维护的是一张有向图：节点是区段，边是&quot;允许流向&quot;，每条边上挂一个<strong>占用状态位</strong>。区段长度通常取一件标准货的长度加一个安全余量，这样&quot;一个区段最多一件货&quot;成为一条不变式（invariant），图上的状态就能退化成一张布尔占用表。</p>\n<p>汇流点是拓扑里最容易出问题的地方。两条线同时向一个交汇点放行，就会撞在一起，因此合流必须由一个<strong>仲裁逻辑</strong>串行化：常见做法是给每条支线一个请求信号，由汇流控制器（往往是本地 PLC 或 MCP 逻辑）在时序上错开放行，保证交汇区内任一时刻只有一件货。这在工程上等价于一个互斥锁，而 WCS 的上层只需下发&quot;支线 A 优先&quot;或&quot;动态优先级&quot;的策略。</p>\n<p>分流点的难点不在机械，而在<strong>路由决策的下发时机</strong>。分流必须提前一个&quot;位置窗口&quot;知道目标格口，窗口由线速与分流机构动作时间共同决定：线速 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span> 越高、动作时间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{act}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 越长，就需要越早下达指令，提前距离 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d = v \\cdot t_{act}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。因此 WCS 的分单不是在包裹到达分流口时决定，而是在扫描点读取条码时就把&quot;目标格口&quot;绑定到该包裹的运输实体上，沿途各区段只转发这个绑定值。本 hub 的 <a href=\"../wcs-architecture-equipment-model/\">WCS 架构与设备模型</a> 一章会展开这一运输实体在系统间的表达方式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"积放模式-zpa-的传感与放行逻辑\">积放模式：ZPA 的传感与放行逻辑</h2><p>ZPA 的核心机制是&quot;传感—放行&quot;闭环。每个区段末端（下游边界）装一个传感器，用于判断下游区段是否被占用。本节点的规则很简单：<strong>只有当下游区段为空，本区段才允许启动</strong>；否则本区段制动，让货停在自己的区段内。因为区段长度大于货长，队列中相邻两件货之间自然留出间隙，压力被&quot;区段&quot;这个离散单位截断，这正是&quot;零压力&quot;的含义。</p>\n<p>放行逻辑有两种常见变体，工程上要按场景选：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>递减放行（cascade / 逐级传递）</strong>：下游空了，信号像多米诺一样逐级往上游传。实现简单、成本低，但整条队列的启动有传播延迟。</li>\n<li><strong>集中/前瞻放行（look-ahead）</strong>：控制器一次看到数个区段，按队列头部顺序批量放行，启动更快，适合长积放线。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>ZPA 的工程参数主要是三个：<strong>区段长度</strong>、<strong>最小间隙</strong>、<strong>制动距离</strong>。区段长度取货长加间隙；最小间隙要能容纳工人的手或机械抓取而不碰邻件（这也是 safety 侧对齐 ISO 13849 时评估的点 [来源：ISO 13849-1，2023 版，PL 与 PFHd 分档，<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_13849]）；制动距离则决定高速线必须用减速曲线而非急停，否则货会冲进下一区段。一个常见的错误是把\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_13849]）；制动距离则决定高速线必须用减速曲线而非急停，否则货会冲进下一区段。一个常见的错误是把</a> ZPA 区段做得过长以求&quot;多缓存&quot;，结果单区段内放两件货，不变式被破坏，占用表失真，出现&quot;幽灵包裹&quot;——线体明明空了，WCS 却认为有货，导致整段死锁。</p>\n<h2 id=\"流量控制-吞吐-节拍与缓冲计算\">流量控制：吞吐、节拍与缓冲计算</h2><p>输送线的一切流量问题都可以用两个公式收束。第一是<strong>最大放行率</strong>：当线速为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span>、最小件间距为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>g</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g_{min}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">min</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 时，单通道理论最大流量为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>v</mi><msub><mi>g</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda_{max} = \\frac{v}{g_{min}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.988em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">min</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>例如线速 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1.5</mn><mtext> m/s</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v = 1.5\\ \\text{m/s}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.5</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">m/s</span></span></span></span></span></span>、最小间距 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>g</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0.3</mn><mtext> m</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g_{min} = 0.3\\ \\text{m}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">min</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.3</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">m</span></span></span></span></span></span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mtext> 件/s</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>18000</mn><mtext> 件/h</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda_{max} = 5\\ \\text{件/s} = 18000\\ \\text{件/h}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">件</span><span class=\"mord\">/s</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">18000</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">件</span><span class=\"mord\">/h</span></span></span></span></span></span>。这是单线的天花板，任何分流、汇流、扫描都会进一步压低它。</p>\n<p>第二是<strong>缓冲容量与等待时间的关系</strong>，即利特尔法则（Little&#39;s Law）：积放段中在制品数量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 与其平均停留时间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N = \\lambda \\cdot T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>它把&quot;要吸收多大的突发流量&quot;翻译成&quot;需要多少个积放位&quot;。若上游瞬时来流 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.8</mn><mtext> 件/s</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda = 0.8\\ \\text{件/s}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.8</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">件</span><span class=\"mord\">/s</span></span></span></span></span></span>，而下游分流口只能稳定处理 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.6</mn><mtext> 件/s</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.6\\ \\text{件/s}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.6</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">件</span><span class=\"mord\">/s</span></span></span></span></span></span>，则超出部分必须以队列形式存住；要撑住 60 秒的峰值，需要 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0.8</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>0.6</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mn>60</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N = (0.8 - 0.6) \\times 60 = 12</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0.8</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.6</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12</span></span></span></span></span> 个积放位，也就是约 12 个区段。这个数字直接决定积放段的物理长度与投资。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>控制目标</th>\n<th>关键参数</th>\n<th>工程含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单线吞吐</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>g</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g_{min}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">min</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>线速与间距的比值，是全局上限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>突发吸收</td>\n<td>积放位数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>由利特尔法则反推，等于缓存的&quot;钱&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分单正确率</td>\n<td>提前距离 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d = v \\cdot t_{act}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>决定分流指令何时下发</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>汇流不碰撞</td>\n<td>仲裁优先级</td>\n<td>交汇区互斥，任一时刻一件货</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>由此得出流量控制的一条实践原则：<strong>瓶颈决定一切</strong>。拓扑上最慢的那个节点（通常是分流口或人工打包台）决定整线的实际吞吐，其余段的优化都是无效劳动。因此 WCS 的拥塞控制通常做成&quot;反压（backpressure）&quot;——当下游积放段接近满位时，主动向上游减速或暂停投放，而不是让上游把货硬推到堵死。</p>\n<h2 id=\"mcp-与-plc-的区段控制实现\">MCP 与 PLC 的区段控制实现</h2><p>区段级控制落地的载体是 <strong>MCP（Motor Control Panel，电机控制面板）</strong>。一个 MCP 通常控制邻近的一簇区段（例如 8–16 个 MDR 区段），内部完成 24V 直流供电、电机驱动与本地 I/O 采集，再通过工业以太网把区段状态上报给 WCS/PLC。这种&quot;分层&quot;设计的价值在于：单点故障被限制在一个面板内，且现场只需一根通信线而非把每个传感器都拉回中央柜。</p>\n<p>控制器逻辑按 IEC 61131-3 实现。该标准的第四版发布于 2025 年 5 月，定义了三种图形化语言（LD 梯形图、FBD 功能块图、SFC 顺序功能图）和一种文本语言（ST 结构化文本），并在此前版本中废除了 IL 指令表 [来源：IEC 61131-3，第四版 2025-05，<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/IEC_61131-3]。ZPA\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/IEC_61131-3]。ZPA</a> 的&quot;传感—放行&quot;逻辑用 LD 或 FBD 表达最直观，而队列仲裁这类状态机用 SFC 或 ST 更清晰。区段扫描周期要与电机响应时间匹配，通常要求毫秒级，才能保证制动指令不迟到。</p>\n<p>与上位 WCS 的通信有三条主流路线：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Modbus TCP</strong>：默认端口 502，用功能码读写线圈与保持寄存器，实现极简，适合把区段占用位映射成寄存器位 [来源：Wikipedia, Modbus，<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Modbus]。\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Modbus]。</a></li>\n<li><strong>OPC UA（IEC 62541）</strong>：面向服务、带信息模型与安全栈，规范 1.05.06 于 2025 年 10 月发布；其 PubSub（Part 14）支持 UDP/MQTT 等映射，适合区段状态的大规模广播 [来源：Wikipedia, OPC Unified Architecture，<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/OPC_Unified_Architecture]。\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/OPC_Unified_Architecture]。</a></li>\n<li><strong>实时工业以太网</strong>：对运动同步要求高的场景（如高速交叉带分拣的同步落包），Profibus &amp; PROFINET International 定义的 PROFINET 提供 RT 类（周期 1–10 ms）与 IRT 类（周期低于 1 ms，配合时钟同步偏差 1 μs 以内），EtherCAT 则以标准以太帧（EtherType 0x88a4）实现 ≤100 μs 的循环与 ≤1 μs 抖动 [来源：Wikipedia, PROFINET；Wikipedia, EtherCAT，<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/EtherCAT]。\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/EtherCAT]。</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>安全侧必须与流量控制分离设计。输送线的急停、拉绳、安全门与非接触防护，其安全功能按 ISO 13849-1（2023 版）评定所需性能等级 PLr，并以每小时危险失效概率 PFHd 量化可达的 PL（PLa 对应 PFHd &lt; <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1\\times10^{-4}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>/h，PLe 对应 ≤ <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1\\times10^{-8}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">8</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>/h）[来源：ISO 13849-1，2023 版，同上]。这意味着&quot;让货停在正确位置&quot;是 WCS 的业务逻辑，而&quot;让人不被夹住&quot;是独立的安全回路，两者不能共用同一条软件路径。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>输送线是区段构成的有向图，节点分运输段、积放段、决策点三类；<strong>区段是状态与控制的最小单位，不是电机</strong>。</li>\n<li>ZPA 的本质是用&quot;一个区段一件货&quot;做离散缓冲，靠传感—放行闭环保持单件间隙，从而避免压力累积与卡件。</li>\n<li>积放模式三选一：接触积放密度高但会挤压，ZPA 最平衡，动态积放适合高速运行中等待。</li>\n<li>吞吐由 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>g</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda_{max} = v / g_{min}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">min</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 决定上限，缓冲由利特尔法则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N = \\lambda T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 反推，分单提前量由 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d = v \\cdot t_{act}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 决定。</li>\n<li>落地载体是 MCP 面板 + IEC 61131-3 逻辑 + Modbus/OPC UA/工业以太网通信；安全回路按 ISO 13849 独立评定，不并入业务逻辑。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"输送线拓扑、积放与流量控制（ZPA）","id":"输送线拓扑-积放与流量控制-zpa"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"输送线拓扑建模：区段、汇流与分流","id":"输送线拓扑建模-区段-汇流与分流"},{"level":2,"text":"积放模式：ZPA 的传感与放行逻辑","id":"积放模式-zpa-的传感与放行逻辑"},{"level":2,"text":"流量控制：吞吐、节拍与缓冲计算","id":"流量控制-吞吐-节拍与缓冲计算"},{"level":2,"text":"MCP 与 PLC 的区段控制实现","id":"mcp-与-plc-的区段控制实现"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"任务状态机、指令下发确认与幂等重试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/warehouse-control-system-sortation-automation-asrs/wcs-architecture-equipment-model/task-state-machine-idempotent-dispatch"},"next":{"title":"分拣格口分配与目的地路由策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/warehouse-control-system-sortation-automation-asrs/conveyor-sortation-routing/sortation-chute-destination-routing"}}